  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional strengthening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to extend institutional strengthening assistance for Albania&apos;s National Ozone Unit (NOU) for a further phase from July 2024 to June 2027. Sustained support for the NOU is critical for enabling Albania to meet its goals under the Montreal Protocol on Substances that Deplete the Ozone Layer.  The NOU plays a crucial coordination role across industry, government agencies and other stakeholders to phase out use of ozone-depleting substances (ODS) and transition to environmentally-friendly alternatives.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montreal Protocol</narrative>
  </participating-org>
